      "widgets_values": [
        "One continuous six-second fixed-camera full-body shot, exactly ONE man, starting exactly like <Picture 1>. The reference pictures show different views of this SAME man, not separate people and not a contact sheet output. Preserve his short dark hair, pale yellow patterned short-sleeved shirt, blue jeans, dark shoes and body proportions. He turns clockwise halfway around, demonstrating a character turnaround: begin facing camera, show three-quarter front, then a clear full side profile around two seconds, three-quarter back, then full BACK VIEW by four seconds. Hold the back view until the end, with back of head and shirt toward camera, no face visible. A single complete head-to-toe body, both feet on the ground; feet pivot naturally, arms relaxed. Grey studio background and lighting stay unchanged. At the beginning he says in a clear natural male Mandarin voice: “请看我的背面。” Then only synchronized shoe scuffs and fabric movement. No music, extra people, split-screen, montage, captions or overlays.",
